// Urban Reign Redux: experimental multiplayer orbit camera
// Adapted from the user-supplied community camera controls (DangerX7 context).
// L3: follow the player using that controller. R3: restore shared multiplayer camera.
// Focus automatically releases when the selected player has no HP.
// Lab-only: camera modes and controller handling still require in-game validation.
// No co-op, character stats, enemy, mission or timer patches included.
// Match-start default: solo human P1 follows P1; additional human players use shared camera.
